\p{
The agda-unimath library is a community formalization project for univalent
mathematics in Agda. The library project was created by [Elisabeth
Stenholm](elisabethstenholm), [Jonathan Prieto-Cubides](jonathanprietocubides), and
[Egbert Rijke](egbertrijke), and is currently being maintained by [Egbert
Rijke](egbertrijke), [Fredrik Bakke](fredrikbakke), and [Elif Uskuplu](elifuskuplu).
Our goal is to formalize an extensive curriculum of mathematics from the univalent
point of view. Furthermore, we think libraries of formalized mathematics have the
potential to be useful, and informative resources for mathematicians. Our library is
designed to work towards this goal, and we welcome contributions to the library about
any topic in mathematics.
}

